-      <li><div><b>Execute the contrast, don't imagine it</b>In an empty room the robot runs both commands: walk through, and request the crouch at 0.30 s. We keep the achieved 50 Hz body trajectories, not the reference the controller was asked to track.</div></li>
-      <li><div><b>Place the beam where the two executions differ</b>Any placement the crouch clears by 10 mm and the walk strikes by 10 mm is a candidate. Four constructions compete: uniform, an analytic capsule-box solver, a learned generator, and a target-only ablation that never looks at the walk.</div></li>
