+      <p>The recorded venue is ICRA 2027, eight pages including references, closing 15 September 2026. Of the five items below, only the first fits that window at ≈7.6 GPU-hours. Items 2 through 5 do not, and this page does not pretend otherwise.</p>
+    </div>
