+    <div class="road">
+      <article>
+        <h3>Methods paper — the contribution has narrowed and is still real</h3>
+        <p class="why">Target: ICRA 2027. The abstract and performance claims are limited to completed development evidence.</p>
+        <p>The defensible claim today is mechanistic rather than performance-based: <em>executed-motion construction reliably concentrates physical labelling on solvable adaptation-required encounters, and that is not sufficient to teach perceptive selection.</em> What distinguishes the corpora that trained selective policies is response complementarity across the corpus, and the executed-envelope screen predicts that property with high precision and low recall. The acquisition-stage yield advantage is <strong>not</strong> the downstream result, and this page does not present it as one.</p>
