+        <p class="why">Because it is the smallest test of the one mechanism the calibration actually implicated.</p>
+        <p>Complete the 288 acquisition episodes and the 200-episode validation panel. It settles whether restoring proposal support outside the negative screen changes physically executed passage, and it distinguishes "broadening support helps" from "the guided half adds value". If action diversity improves without passage improving, the central hypothesis stays unsupported.</p>
