+        <p>Eighteen reserved layouts are geometry-locked with their generation recorded at zero clearance queries and zero physics steps. They have <strong>never been executed</strong>, and eight of nine adoption gates remain unmet — the implementation lock and the finite-horizon terminal-censoring policy must be fixed before a single episode runs. This is the difference between a development claim and a held-out one.</p>
