-        <p>Eight candidate source identifiers are reserved against a provenance ledger and none has been generated or qualified. Acquire them, qualify their switching banks under the same 0.30 s contract, and re-run the four-arm comparison with ancestry held out. This is the single largest gap between the present claim and a general one, and it needs no new method.</p>
