-        <p class="why">Because a refusal here continues walking; it is not a stop.</p>
-        <p>Nothing in this study is a protective action. Before any physical trial the command bank needs a genuine abort, the blocked-scene classification needs to drive it, and contact thresholds calibrated in simulation need re-derivation against real contact sensing. Treat the 1 N contact-qualified criterion as a simulation convention, not a safety margin.</p>
