+    <h2>What this is not</h2>
+    <div class="gate warn">
+      <p>Everything here is simulation: one overhead-beam family along a fixed approach, seven qualified schedules, three decision phases, at most one adaptation followed by recovery, ideal ray sensing, and one frozen inherited controller whose locomotion capability is not a contribution of this work.</p>
+      <p><strong>Every completed evaluation on this page is development or regression evidence.</strong> No result reported here is protected held-out: layouts were withheld from fitting, but some had published outcomes before the learner form was chosen, and source ancestry was never varied. A protected held-out evaluation is item 2 on the remaining-work list, not a property of any result shown. Acceptance was judged at the exact pose the simulator authors, so nothing here is uncertainty-robust. No claim is made about general navigation, steering, protective stopping, repeated skill chaining, hardware transfer, or energy efficiency. Passage time is crossing plus stabilization, not full maneuver completion.</p>
